  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop garlic. Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Drain and rinse black beans. Drain sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645a1126ab5b0f779e0eed0c/step-dbc8dad1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook capsicum and corn, stirring, until softened, 5-7 minutes.\n• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot. Add less if you're sensitive to heat. Add Mexican Fiesta spice blend and garlic. Cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645a1126ab5b0f779e0eed0c/step-a1e01a0f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, beans, vegetable stock powder, the brown sugar and the hot water (see ingredients). Stir to combine.\n• Bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium and simmer until slightly thickened, 10-15 minutes.\n• Stir in the butter. Season with salt and pepper. TIP: Butter helps balance the acidity of the tomatoes!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645a1126ab5b0f779e0eed0c/step-3410a4fe.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the chilli is simmering, cut mini flour tortillas (see ingredients) into wedges.\n• Place tortilla chips on a lined oven tray. Drizzle (or spray) with olive oil. Season, then arrange in a single layer.\n• When the chilli has 10 minutes remaining, bake the chips until golden, 6-8 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is getting crowded, spread the chips out over two oven trays",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645a1126ab5b0f779e0eed0c/step-9769cb99.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop coriander.\n• Slice avocado in half and scoop out flesh. Place avocado in a small bowl and mash with a fork.\n• Add sour cream and stir to combine. Season to taste. TIP: For a smoother crema, use a food processor or stick blender.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645a1126ab5b0f779e0eed0c/step-286f6967.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mexican capsicum chilli between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with shredded Cheddar cheese and coriander.\n• Top with a dollop of avocado crema. Serve with baked tortilla chips. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/645a1126ab5b0f779e0eed0c/step-3a67ecc0.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
